{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The X-Plane 12 sim-wings Hamburg DLC offers an incredibly realistic scenery of Hamburg Airport and the immediate vicinity.<br>Elaborately color-corrected aerial photos for a true color display and a realistic 3D ground with elevated Lufthansa maintenance, lowered highway and half covered highway makes Hamburg Airport appear very lifelike. The extremely detailed airport buildings with interiors and all auxiliary buildings support this aspect.<br><br>Also included are the new &quot;Interim Terminal&quot; and new stands placed using ground maps from the airport operator. Thanks to the animated jetways and the realistic night time dynamic lighting, the airport seems very lively.<br><br>Fly to Hamburg Airport today and experience the realism of sim-wings Hamburg in X-Plane 12!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Highly detailed scenery of Hamburg Airport and the immediate vicinity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic 3D ground with elevated Lufthansa maintenance, lowered highway and half covered highway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aerial photo for the airport and the surrounding area, elaborately color-corrected for a true color display (incl. normal map and seasonal variants)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed ground lines and stands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New &quot;Interims Terminal&quot; and new stands according to ground maps of the airport operator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extremely detailed Hamburg airport buildings with interiors and all auxiliary buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lufthansa maintenance area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animated jetways, stairways, marshaller and VDGS (SAM3 or OpenSAM required)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many static apron vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom animated vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic night time dynamic lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reworked autogen and street placement\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full support for native XP12 seasons, with no other add-ons or plugins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weather effects for wet, snow and ice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">XP12 3D vegetation for forests, trees and bushes for seamless integration into the environment</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2970710?t=1753433226","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2970710?t=1753433226","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2970710/94a745befa9a97ff8ffc23e402430cbdfe174e15/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753433226","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2970710/94a745befa9a97ff8ffc23e402430cbdfe174e15/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753433226","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The X-Plane 12 sim-wings Hamburg DLC offers an incredibly realistic scenery of Hamburg Airport and the immediate vicinity.<br>Elaborately color-corrected aerial photos for a true color display and a realistic 3D ground with elevated Lufthansa maintenance, lowered highway and half covered highway makes Hamburg Airport appear very lifelike. The extremely detailed airport buildings with interiors and all auxiliary buildings support this aspect.<br><br>Also included are the new &quot;Interim Terminal&quot; and new stands placed using ground maps from the airport operator. Thanks to the animated jetways and the realistic night time dynamic lighting, the airport seems very lively.<br><br>Fly to Hamburg Airport today and experience the realism of sim-wings Hamburg in X-Plane 12!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Highly detailed scenery of Hamburg Airport and the immediate vicinity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic 3D ground with elevated Lufthansa maintenance, lowered highway and half covered highway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aerial photo for the airport and the surrounding area, elaborately color-corrected for a true color display (incl. normal map and seasonal variants)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed ground lines and stands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New &quot;Interims Terminal&quot; and new stands according to ground maps of the airport operator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extremely detailed Hamburg airport buildings with interiors and all auxiliary buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lufthansa maintenance area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animated jetways, stairways, marshaller and VDGS (SAM3 or OpenSAM required)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many static apron vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom animated vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic night time dynamic lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reworked autogen and street placement\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full support for native XP12 seasons, with no other add-ons or plugins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weather effects for wet, snow and ice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">XP12 3D vegetation for forests, trees and bushes for seamless integration into the environment</p></li></ul>","developers":["sim-wings"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2014780","name":"X-Plane 12"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steams